<?php if($cUnmatched||$cSuggested):?><div class="room-unmatched" style="margin-top:12px"><h3>🔍 Son 30 işlemde görülen kodlar · tüm ürünler</h3><p class="conn-hint">Bu bağlantıdan gelen son 30 bildirimde görülen dış oda kodlarının durumu (ürün seçilmeden, tüm ürünler). <b>Eşlenmemiş</b> (kırmızı nokta): hiçbir oda tipine bağlı değil — veri yazılmaz; <b>otomatik önerilen</b> (turuncu nokta): onay bekliyor. Eşleştirme ve onay bölüm 3'te yapılır.</p><div class="room-unmatched-codes"><?php foreach($cUnmatched as $uc=>$uv):?><span class="code-chip-wrap"><button type="button" class="conn-code-chip" data-conn="<?=(int)$c['id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)($uv['p']??0)?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($uc)?>" title="Eşlenmemiş kanal oda kodu — <?=(int)$uv['c']?> işlemde görüldü · tıkla: son webhook kaydını göster"><span class="room-um-dot" style="background:#b0301a"></span><?=htmlspecialchars($uc)?> <small>eşlenmemiş · <?=(int)$uv['c']?> işlem · son <?= $uv['t'] ? htmlspecialchars(date('d.m',strtotime((string)$uv['t']))) : '—' ?></small></button><button type="button" class="chip-action" data-act="flow" title="Bölüm 3'te hızlı eşleştirme başlat">⚡</button></span><?php endforeach;?><?php foreach($cSuggested as $scode=>$sm):$sv=$cSeenInfo[$scode]??null;?><span class="code-chip-wrap"><button type="button" class="conn-code-chip" data-conn="<?=(int)$c['id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)($sm['property_id']??0)?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($scode)?>" title="Öneri: <?=htmlspecialchars($sm['room_name']??('#'.(int)$sm['room_type_id']))?> · <?=htmlspecialchars($sm['property_name']??'')?> · tıkla: son webhook kaydını göster"><span class="room-um-dot" style="background:#b26a00"></span><?=htmlspecialchars($scode)?> <small>→ <?=htmlspecialchars($sm['room_name']??('#'.(int)$sm['room_type_id']))?><?= $sm['suggestion_score']!==null?' (%'.(int)$sm['suggestion_score'].')':'' ?> · <?=(int)($sv['c']??0)?> işlem</small></button><button type="button" class="chip-action" data-act="flow" title="Bölüm 3'te hızlı eşleştirme/onay başlat">⚡</button></span><?php endforeach;?><div class="room-verify-result" id="conn-verify-<?=(int)$c['id']?>" hidden></div></div></div><?php endif;?><p class="conn-hint">Kanal tarafına bildirimler için bu webhook adresini verin. Bağlantı aktif olduğunda gönderilen JSON bildirimleri işlem günlüğünde görünür.</p></article><?php endforeach;?></section>
<section class="next-module"><h2>2. Ürün eşleştirmesi</h2><p>Bağlantı aktifleştirilmeden önce NEXUS ürününüzü kanalın tesis koduna bağlayın. Oda eşleştirmeleri sonraki adımda (bölüm 3) yapılır.</p><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="property_map"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal<select name="connection_id"><?php foreach($connections as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>NEXUS ürünü<select name="property_id"><?php foreach($properties as $p):?><option value="<?=$p['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($p['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Kanal ürün kodu<input name="external_property_id" required></label></div><button>Eşleştirmeyi kaydet</button></form><?php foreach($mappings as $m):?><p><b><?=htmlspecialchars($m['display_name'])?></b> · <?=htmlspecialchars($m['property_name'])?> → <?=htmlspecialchars($m['external_property_id'])?></p><?php endforeach;?></section>
<section class="next-module"><h2>3. Oda eşleştirmesi</h2><p>Kanalın webhook bildirimlerinde gönderdiği <b>dış oda kodu</b> ile NEXUS <b>oda/birim tipi + fiyat planı</b> çiftini aynı satırda eşleştirin; plan "İlk aktif plan" bırakılırsa varsayılan kullanılır. Fiyat, kontenjan, kısıt ve rezervasyon bildirimleri doğru oda tipine ve plana yazılır. <b>Tanınmayan kod</b> (kontrol merkezi ayarı açıkken) ilk aktif oda tipine yazılmaz — aşağıda <b>onay bekleyen öneri</b> olarak listelenir; onaylanınca o koda ait satırlar yazılmaya başlar.</p><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_edit"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal<select name="connection_id"><?php foreach($connections as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>NEXUS ürünü<select name="property_id"><?php foreach($properties as $p):?><option value="<?=$p['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($p['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label></div><button>Eşleştirmeleri düzenle →</button></form><?php if(!empty($roomEdit)): $rmq=$pdo->prepare('SELECT id, room_type_id, rate_plan_id, external_room_id, status, suggestion_count, suggested_at, suggestion_score FROM channel_room_mappings WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=? ORDER BY (status=\'suggested\') DESC, id');$rmq->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$mapByRoom=[];$mapPlanByRoom=[];$suggestions=[];$suggestedRooms=[];foreach($rmq->fetchAll() as $mr){$mapByRoom[(int)$mr['room_type_id']]=$mr['external_room_id'];$mapPlanByRoom[(int)$mr['room_type_id']]=$mr['rate_plan_id']!==null?(int)$mr['rate_plan_id']:0;if($mr['status']==='suggested'){$suggestions[]=$mr;$suggestedRooms[(int)$mr['room_type_id']]=true;}}$rq=$pdo->prepare('SELECT id,name,status FROM room_types WHERE property_id=? ORDER BY name');$rq->execute([$roomEdit['property_id']]);$roomRows=$rq->fetchAll();$roomNames=[];foreach($roomRows as $rr)$roomNames[(int)$rr['id']]=$rr['name'];$plq=$pdo->prepare("SELECT id,name,currency FROM rate_plans WHERE property_id=? AND status='active' ORDER BY id");$plq->execute([$roomEdit['property_id']]);$plans=$plq->fetchAll();$connName='';foreach($connections as $c)if((int)$c['id']===(int)$roomEdit['connection_id'])$connName=$c['display_name'];?><?php if($suggestions):?><div class="room-suggestions"><h3>⏳ Onay bekleyen eşleştirme önerileri</h3><p class="conn-hint">Webhook'ta tanınmayan dış oda kodu geldi; veri onaylanana kadar yazılmadı. <b>Onayla</b> → kod bundan sonra seçili oda tipine yazılır; <b>Reddet</b> → öneri düşer. Farklı bir oda tipine bağlamak için aşağıdaki formdan kod yazıp kaydedin (otomatik onaylanır).</p><?php foreach($suggestions as $sg):?><div class="room-suggestion-wrap" data-verify-box><div class="room-suggestion-row"><div><b><?=htmlspecialchars($sg['external_room_id'])?></b><span>→ <?=htmlspecialchars($roomNames[(int)$sg['room_type_id']]??('#'.(int)$sg['room_type_id']))?><?= ($sg['suggestion_score']??null)!==null?' <b style="color:#b26a00">%'.(int)$sg['suggestion_score'].' benzerlik</b>':'' ?> · <?=(int)$sg['suggestion_count']?> bildirim · son öneri <?=htmlspecialchars((string)($sg['suggested_at']??''))?></span></div><div class="room-suggestion-actions"><button type="button" class="room-verify-btn" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($sg['external_room_id'])?>">Doğrula</button><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_approve"><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?=(int)$sg['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><button>Onayla ✓</button></form><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_reject"><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?=(int)$sg['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><button class="danger-btn">Reddet ✕</button></form></div></div><div class="room-verify-result" hidden></div></div><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?><?php $seen=$pdo->prepare("SELECT request_payload, created_at FROM channel_sync_logs WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=? AND direction='pull' AND request_payload IS NOT NULL ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 30");$seen->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$seenCodes=[];foreach($seen->fetchAll() as $sl){$dec=json_decode((string)$sl['request_payload'],true);if(!is_array($dec)||!isset($dec['entries'])||!is_array($dec['entries']))continue;foreach($dec['entries'] as $en){if(is_array($en)&&isset($en['external_room_id'])&&trim((string)$en['external_room_id'])!==''){$code=trim((string)$en['external_room_id']);if(!isset($seenCodes[$code]))$seenCodes[$code]=['c'=>0,'t'=>(string)$sl['created_at']];$seenCodes[$code]['c']++;}}}$unmatched=[];$autoSuggested=[];$codeTarget=[];if($seenCodes){$pl=$pdo->prepare('SELECT external_room_id, room_type_id, status, suggestion_score FROM channel_room_mappings WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=?');$pl->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$mapInfo=[];foreach($pl->fetchAll() as $mc)$mapInfo[$mc['external_room_id']]=$mc;foreach(array_keys($seenCodes) as $code){if(!isset($mapInfo[$code])){$unmatched[$code]=$seenCodes[$code];$codeTarget[$code]=0;continue;}if($mapInfo[$code]['status']==='suggested'){$autoSuggested[$code]=$seenCodes[$code];$codeTarget[$code]=(int)$mapInfo[$code]['room_type_id'];}}}?><?php if($unmatched||$autoSuggested):?><div class="room-unmatched"><h3>🔍 Son 30 işlemde görülen eşleşmemiş / otomatik eşlenen kodlar</h3><p class="conn-hint">Bu kanaldan gelen son 30 bildirimde görülen dış kodların durumu. <b>Eşlenmemiş</b> (kırmızı nokta): hiçbir oda tipine bağlı değil; <b>otomatik önerilen</b> (turuncu nokta): onay bekliyor, veri yazılmıyor. Chip'e tıklayınca aşağıdaki formda ilgili oda tipinin kodu dolar — kaydederseniz otomatik onaylanır/değişir.</p><div class="room-unmatched-codes"><?php foreach($unmatched as $uc=>$uv):?><span class="code-chip-wrap"><button type="button" class="room-unmatched-chip" data-room="0" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($uc)?>" title="Eşlenmemiş — <?=(int)$uv['c']?> işlemde görüldü · tıkla: son webhook kaydını göster"><span class="room-um-dot" style="background:#b0301a"></span><?=htmlspecialchars($uc)?> <small>eşlenmemiş · <?=(int)$uv['c']?> işlem · son <?= $uv['t'] ? htmlspecialchars(date('d.m',strtotime((string)$uv['t']))) : '—' ?></small></button><button type="button" class="chip-action" data-act="fill" data-room="0" title="Kodu bir oda tipinin alanına doldur">⧉</button></span><?php endforeach;?><?php foreach($autoSuggested as $ac=>$av):$tgt=$codeTarget[$ac]??0;$sc=$mapInfo[$ac]['suggestion_score']??null;?><span class="code-chip-wrap"><button type="button" class="room-unmatched-chip" data-room="<?=(int)$tgt?>" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($ac)?>" title="Öneri: <?=htmlspecialchars($roomNames[$tgt]??('#'.(int)$tgt))?> · tıkla: son webhook kaydını göster"><span class="room-um-dot" style="background:#b26a00"></span><?=htmlspecialchars($ac)?> <small>→ <?=htmlspecialchars($roomNames[$tgt]??('#'.(int)$tgt))?> (öneri<?= $sc!==null?' · %'.(int)$sc:'' ?>) · <?=(int)$av['c']?> işlem</small></button><button type="button" class="chip-action" data-act="fill" data-room="<?=(int)$tgt?>" title="Kodu bu oda tipinin alanına doldur">⧉</button></span><?php endforeach;?><div class="room-verify-result" id="room-list-verify" hidden></div></div></div><?php endif;?><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_save"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><h3><?=htmlspecialchars($connName)?> → oda eşleştirmeleri</h3><p class="conn-hint">Her NEXUS oda tipine kanalın kullandığı dış kodu yazın ve hedef fiyat planını seçin; boş bırakılan satır eşleşmeyi kaldırır, plan boşsa ilk aktif plan kullanılır. Aynı dış kod iki oda tipine verilemez; buradan kaydedilen her satır onaylı kabul edilir.</p><?php if(!empty($roomEdit['quick_code'])):?><div class="room-quick-match"><b>⚡ Hızlı eşleştir:</b> <code><?=htmlspecialchars($roomEdit['quick_code'])?></code><select id="quick-room-select"><?php foreach($roomRows as $qr):?><option value="<?=(int)$qr['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($qr['name'])?><?= $qr['status']==='active'?'':' ('.$qr['status'].')' ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><button type="button" id="quick-match-btn">Kodu oda tipine doldur →</button><span class="conn-hint">Kod seçili oda tipinin alanına dolar; aşağıdaki "Eşleştirmeleri kaydet" ile onaylayın. İptal için kutuyu kapatın.</span></div><?php endif;?><?php foreach($roomRows as $r):$rowCode=(string)($mapByRoom[(int)$r['id']]??'');?><div class="room-map-wrap" data-verify-box><div class="room-map-row"><label><?=htmlspecialchars($r['name'])?><?= $r['status']==='active'?'':' <small>('.$r['status'].')</small>' ?><?= isset($suggestedRooms[(int)$r['id']])?' <small class="sug-badge">öneri bekliyor</small>':'' ?></label><input id="room-code-<?=(int)$r['id']?>" name="rooms[<?=(int)$r['id']?>]" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($rowCode)?>" placeholder="Kanal oda kodu — Örn. OTA-DELUXE"><select name="plans[<?=(int)$r['id']?>]" class="room-map-plan" title="Bu oda tipine gelen fiyat/kontenjanın yazılacağı fiyat planı"><option value="0">İlk aktif plan</option><?php foreach($plans as $pl):?><option value="<?=(int)$pl['id']?>" <?= ($mapPlanByRoom[(int)$r['id']]??0)===(int)$pl['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?=htmlspecialchars($pl['name'].' · '.$pl['currency'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><?php if($rowCode!==''):?><button type="button" class="room-verify-btn" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($rowCode)?>">Doğrula</button><?php endif;?><?php if($rowCode!==''):?><button type="button" class="room-test-btn" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($rowCode)?>" title="Eşleşmeyi NEXUS tarafında test et — kod doğru oda tipine/plana yazılır mı?">Test et</button><select class="room-test-currency" title="Test için webhook fiyat birimi (kur kontrolü)"><option value="">Birim (otomatik)</option><option value="EUR">EUR</option><option value="TRY">TRY</option><option value="USD">USD</option><option value="GBP">GBP</option></select><?php endif;?></div><div class="room-verify-result" hidden></div></div><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$roomRows):?><p style="color:#6b7774">Bu üründe henüz oda/birim tipi yok — önce ilan düzenleyiciden ekleyin.</p><?php endif;?><button>Eşleştirmeleri kaydet →</button></form><?php $pmq=$pdo->prepare('SELECT id, rate_plan_id, external_rate_plan_id, status, suggestion_count, suggested_at, suggestion_score FROM channel_rate_plan_mappings WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=? ORDER BY (status=\'suggested\') DESC, id');$pmq->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$planMapByPlan=[];$planSuggestions=[];$suggestedPlans=[];$planNamesById=[];foreach($plans as $pl)$planNamesById[(int)$pl['id']]=$pl['name'];foreach($pmq->fetchAll() as $pm){$pmId=(int)$pm['rate_plan_id'];if($pm['status']==='suggested'){$planSuggestions[]=$pm;$suggestedPlans[$pmId]=true;}else{$planMapByPlan[$pmId]=$pm['external_rate_plan_id'];}}?><?php if($planSuggestions):?><div class="room-suggestions" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>⏳ Onay bekleyen fiyat planı eşleştirme önerileri</h3><p class="conn-hint">Webhook'ta tanınmayan dış fiyat planı kodu geldi; veri onaylanana kadar yazılmadı. <b>Onayla</b> → kod bundan sonra seçili fiyat planına yazılır; <b>Reddet</b> → öneri düşer. Farklı bir plana bağlamak için aşağıdaki formdan kodu yazıp kaydedin (otomatik onaylanır).</p><?php foreach($planSuggestions as $ps):?><div class="room-suggestion-row"><div><b><?=htmlspecialchars($ps['external_rate_plan_id'])?></b><span>→ <?=htmlspecialchars($planNamesById[(int)$ps['rate_plan_id']]??('#'.(int)$ps['rate_plan_id']))?><?= ($ps['suggestion_score']??null)!==null?' <b style="color:#b26a00">%'.(int)$ps['suggestion_score'].' benzerlik</b>':'' ?> · <?=(int)$ps['suggestion_count']?> bildirim · son öneri <?=htmlspecialchars((string)($ps['suggested_at']??''))?></span></div><div class="room-suggestion-actions"><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="plan_map_approve"><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?=(int)$ps['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><button>Onayla ✓</button></form><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="plan_map_reject"><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?=(int)$ps['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><button class="danger-btn">Reddet ✕</button></form></div></div><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="plan_map_save"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><h3><?=htmlspecialchars($connName)?> → fiyat planı eşleştirmeleri</h3><p class="conn-hint">Webhook yükü <code>external_rate_plan_id</code> gönderdiğinde fiyat/kontenjan buradaki eşleştirmeyle NEXUS planına yazılır; boş satır eşleşmeyi kaldırır. Kodu bilinmeyen plan onay akışına girer (yukarıdaki öneriler). Buradan kaydedilen her satır onaylı kabul edilir.</p><?php foreach($plans as $pl):$pc=(string)($planMapByPlan[(int)$pl['id']]??'');?><div class="room-map-row"><label><?=htmlspecialchars($pl['name'])?> · <?=htmlspecialchars($pl['currency'])?><?= isset($suggestedPlans[(int)$pl['id']])?' <small class="sug-badge">öneri bekliyor</small>':'' ?></label><input name="plan_codes[<?=(int)$pl['id']?>]" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($pc)?>" placeholder="Kanal fiyat planı kodu — Örn. OTA-BAR"></div><?php endforeach;?><button>Plan eşleştirmelerini kaydet →</button></form><?php endif;?></section>
<section class="next-module"><h2>4. Gönderim kuyruğu & işlem günlüğü</h2><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="queue"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal<select name="connection_id"><?php foreach($connections as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Gönderim türü<select name="scope"><option value="availability">Kontenjan</option><option value="rates">Fiyat</option><option value="restrictions">Kısıtlar</option><option value="content">İlan içeriği</option></select></label></div><button>Manuel senkronizasyon başlat</button></form><?php foreach($logs as $log):$logFx=json_decode((string)($log['fx_audit']??'[]'),true);?><p id="sync-log-<?=(int)$log['id']?>"><b><?=htmlspecialchars($log['display_name'])?></b> · <?=htmlspecialchars($log['direction'])?> / <?=htmlspecialchars($log['scope'])?> · <strong><?=htmlspecialchars($log['status'])?></strong> · <?=htmlspecialchars($log['created_at'])?><?php if(is_array($logFx))foreach($logFx as $lf):?><span class="fx-audit-badge" title="<?=htmlspecialchars((string)($lf['from']??'').'→'.(string)($lf['to']??'').' · '.(int)($lf['count']??0).' fiyat · kur '.(float)($lf['rate']??0).' · toplam '.number_format((float)($lf['converted_total']??0),2,',','.').' '.(string)($lf['to']??''))?>"><?=htmlspecialchars((string)($lf['from']??'').'→'.(string)($lf['to']??''))?> · <?=(int)($lf['count']??0)?> fiyat · kur <?=htmlspecialchars((string)($lf['rate']??''))?></span><?php endforeach;?><?= $log['error_message']?' · '.htmlspecialchars($log['error_message']):''?></p><?php endforeach;?></section><script>function fallbackCopy(text){var ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=text;ta.style.position='fixed';ta.style.opacity='0';document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();try{document.execCommand('copy')}catch(e){}document.body.removeChild(ta)}document.querySelectorAll('.ical-copy-btn').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var url=this.getAttribute('data-copy'),btn=this;function done(){btn.textContent='Kopyalandı ✓';btn.classList.add('copied');setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent='Kopyala';btn.classList.remove('copied')},1600)}if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(url).then(done).catch(function(){fallbackCopy(url);done()})}else{fallbackCopy(url);done()}})});function roomVerifyShow(res,conn,prop,code){if(!res)return;res.hidden=false;res.textContent='…';fetch('/nexustraveltech/api/supplier-room-verify.php?connection_id='+encodeURIComponent(conn)+'&property_id='+encodeURIComponent(prop)+'&code='+encodeURIComponent(code),{credentials:'same-origin'}).then(function(r){return r.json()}).then(function(d){if(!d.ok){res.textContent=d.message||'Hata';res.className='room-verify-result err';return;}if(!d.found){res.textContent=d.message||'Bu kod için webhook kaydı yok.';res.className='room-verify-result';return;}var e=d.entry||{},parts=['#'+d.log.id+' · '+d.log.scope+' · '+d.log.status+(d.log.error_message?' · hata: '+d.log.error_message:'')+' · '+d.log.created_at];if(e.date)parts.push('tarih: '+e.date);if(e.price!==undefined&&e.price!==null&&e.price!=='')parts.push('fiyat: '+e.price+(e.currency?' '+e.currency:''));if(e.allotment!==undefined&&e.allotment!==null)parts.push('kontenjan: '+e.allotment);if(e.stop_sale!==undefined)parts.push('satış kapalı: '+(e.stop_sale?'evet':'hayır'));if(e.min_stay!==undefined)parts.push('min konaklama: '+e.min_stay);if(e.max_stay!==undefined&&e.max_stay!==null)parts.push('max konaklama: '+e.max_stay);if(d.summary)parts.push(d.summary.applied_rows+' uygulandı · '+d.summary.skipped_rows+' atlandı (son '+d.summary.logs_seen+' işlem)');if(d.fx_audit&&d.fx_audit.length){var fx=d.fx_audit.map(function(f){return f.from+'→'+f.to+' · kur '+f.rate+(f.count>1?' · '+f.count+' fiyat':'')+' · '+f.original_total+' '+f.from+' → '+f.converted_total+' '+f.to;});parts.push('dönüşüm: '+fx.join('; '));}res.textContent=parts.join(' · ');res.className='room-verify-result'+(d.log.status==='failed'?' err':'');if(d.log.status==='failed'){var a=document.createElement('a');a.href='#sync-log-'+(d.log.id||0);a.className='verify-log-jump';a.textContent=' İşlem günlüğünde gör →';a.addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();var r=document.getElementById('sync-log-'+(d.log.id||0));if(r){r.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});r.classList.add('log-row-flash');setTimeout(function(){r.classList.remove('log-row-flash')},2200)}});res.appendChild(a);}if(d.series&&d.series.length){var maxP=0,maxA=0;d.series.forEach(function(s){if(s.price!==null&&s.price!==undefined&&s.price>maxP)maxP=s.price;if(s.allotment!==null&&s.allotment!==undefined&&s.allotment>maxA)maxA=s.allotment;});var wrap=document.createElement('div');wrap.className='room-series';var head=document.createElement('div');head.className='room-series-head';head.textContent='Son 30 gün: fiyat / kontenjan serisi ('+d.series.length+' gün veri)';wrap.appendChild(head);var bars=document.createElement('div');bars.className='room-series-bars';d.series.forEach(function(s){var col=document.createElement('div');col.className='rs-col';var tip=''+(s.date||'')+(s.price!==null&&s.price!==undefined?' · fiyat: '+s.price:'')+(s.allotment!==null&&s.allotment!==undefined?' · kontenjan: '+s.allotment:'');col.title=tip;if(s.price!==null&&s.price!==undefined){var p=document.createElement('i');p.className='rs-price';p.style.height=(6+Math.round((s.price/maxP)*30))+'px';col.appendChild(p);}if(s.allotment!==null&&s.allotment!==undefined){var q=document.createElement('i');q.className='rs-allot';q.style.height=(6+Math.round((s.allotment/maxA)*30))+'px';col.appendChild(q);}var lbl=document.createElement('span');lbl.className='rs-lbl';lbl.textContent=(''+(s.date||'')).slice(8,10);col.appendChild(lbl);bars.appendChild(col);});wrap.appendChild(bars);res.appendChild(wrap);}}).catch(function(){res.textContent='Doğrulama yapılamadı (ağ/oturum).';res.className='room-verify-result err';});}
document.querySelectorAll('.room-unmatched-chip').forEach(function(ch){ch.addEventListener('click',function(){roomVerifyShow(document.getElementById('room-list-verify'),ch.dataset.conn,ch.dataset.prop,ch.dataset.code);})});
